age damage on either node.","evidence_ids":["cmd-84b43c1fe4434d19","cmd-79e85487d5724d9b","cmd-a10064c03a72404d","cmd-8aa0eafeff0d4395","cmd-73e3323109ce4fbe","cmd-0c43e69e0e034963","cmd-f505221d0bbc4a9c","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:package-health","global:after_executor:node2:failed-services","global:after_executor:node2:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied. The provider-wide restart protocol is also complete for both nodes: each has a healthy pre-restart state, restart acknowledgement, changed boot identity corroborated by lifecycle snapshots, and recovered services and backup state. Node2 additionally completed a successful post-restart backup to node1.","limitations":["The source directory was initially absent and remained empty, so the evidence validates archiving and transfer of the directory structure but not preservation of substantive file contents.","The actual overnight cron invocation was not observed; scheduling is established through the active cron service, installed entry, and successful direct execution of the same script."]}
